# CR 701.27f: "If an activated or triggered ability of a permanent that isn't a delayed triggered ability of that
# permanent tries to transform it, the permanent does so only if it hasn't transformed or converted since the ability
# was put onto the stack." Sunfall makes an Incubator with one +1/+1 counter on turn 1. On turn 3 Bot1 activates its
# "{2}: Transform this token." twice, holding priority, so both are on the stack. The top one resolves and the token
# turns into the Phyrexian; the one below finds it has transformed since it was put on the stack and does nothing, so the
# token stays a 1/1 Phyrexian artifact creature. Were the instruction obeyed, it would turn back into an Incubator
# (`incubator-token-transforms-into-a-phyrexian-creature-with-its-counters` is the single activation that transforms).

